    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a string copy event. This event is triggered when a string is copied to the clipboard. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>String</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The string that was copied.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
This class represents an event that occurs when a string is copied.</para>
<para>It contains the string that was copied and provides methods to access this string and get a string representation of the event. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
